{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qcGBzjaZhntcd9DELvVpDg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:17.750531+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qcGBzjaZhntcd9DELvVpDg","html":"<div><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/HQ1xrkfdVRW28vXjvhxoXo8RcBxDYwm7htYKMMwxmKZculq3KU1hGk4p5NabAJiaGZAeLYDpZbC6V6IYkE6u7kZL3unu316p4CyBswfXnKSo/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><p><span><strong><span>2026年江苏省研究生</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>“智能网联”暑期学校</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>即将开班</span></strong></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><strong><span>此次暑期学校由江苏省工学4类</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>研究生教育指导委员会主办</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>南通大学研究生院</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>交通与土木工程学院承办</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>欢迎您的参与</span></strong></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/HQ1xrkfdVRVLeMQDCdViaf1PGl6ClRoeFhsyyE4HwpuibVTn8j3PpTWhRbLLkBzWYXYOGJEH1eicoSOhgQsRlgic0T3dDro0ibQ7yRzWE1JeU0YU/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>当前，以智能化、网联化、电动化、共享化为核心的新一轮汽车产业变革加速演进，智能网联已成为国家战略性新兴产业与交通强国建设的关键抓手。2026年作为“十五五”规划开局之年，国家着力落地智能网联汽车、自动驾驶、车路协同场景应用，系统搭建交通感知网络，对道路基础设施实施网联化改造。多年来，南通大学始终秉承“学必期于用，用必适于地”的办学理念，在交通运输工程、人工智能等学科领域形成了自己的研究特色和较强的科研能力。本次暑期学校旨在策应智能化时代浪潮，充分利用南通大学自身的学科特点和优势，搭建与国内同类学科、同行专家的沟通交流平台，拓宽研究生的学术视野，助推我省相关专业研究生教育高质量创新发展。</span></span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"1.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/HQ1xrkfdVRXUGuSs87U6jSY22sJfZvgdW246zkWlBgKy66lld3Y6FaicXpWbvmcVF5DPNPBVV14Ucmxia82L1PCk0X4frnq0lualqPbL1Nhzg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>1</span></strong></span><strong title=\"\"></strong></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>办学目标</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>本次暑期学校以“跨域融合·智联未来”为主题，坚持前沿化、项目化、多样化、长效化的办学导向，紧扣智能网联汽车、车路协同、智慧交通等国家战略与江苏产业发展急需，整合全省优质研究生课程与实践资源，打造跨学科、跨校际、跨校企的高水平暑期学校平台。通过国内外高水平专家授课、项目实践教学与学术交流，助力研究生更新知识体系、拓宽学术视野、加强学术交流，培养具有创新能力和工程实践素养的高层次智能网联人才，服务江苏特色高质量研究生教育体系建设。</span></span></p><p><span><span><img alt=\"2.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/HQ1xrkfdVRVoEN73mzW8VvRX8vJrcRqnyjzItI481zaoQrokibtfIN0WewtueSHVXLv1ofNQ0fIB8v0Y4kPKz8Enb5jdz5ziaAUw2vhvNvuLE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>2</span></strong></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>学习方式</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>教学方式：</span></span></strong></span><span><span>暑期学校以线下方式开展，包括专题报告、技术讲座、现场调研、学术交流等形式。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>主要课程：</span></span></strong></span><span><span>智慧交通与智能网联概述、面向智能网联的高效通信与协同网络技术、智能网联驾驶风险评估与安全测试、智能网联环境下的驾驶规划与行为决策技术、智能网联环境下的智能感知技术、智能网联环境下的人机共驾技术等特色课程。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"3.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/HQ1xrkfdVRVRTicPVmuia4nEjI7h1wNPYNw0Mbq1iaNJ5cNFEVr13IAiaZHAEZ6O3Qzn07mhgLLuD3BJtSLZ6BNhBNMa5GHMkQTH95Nh84zDzCU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>3</span></strong></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>时间安排</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span><span><span>报名时间</span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span>2026年8月1日-8月16日</span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span>活动时间</span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span>2026年8月23日-8月29日</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><img alt=\"8.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/HQ1xrkfdVRXnEsydFsfYjvIEHpGrjCKloI1XMNUlcj5PkvCQoIz6u8tphXeO6U9H2rOia1w6SnZIOeFX9HIOSYC8Ket1vvDZFCqOXibabibgYk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></span></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>4</span></strong></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>报名条件</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>招生对象：</span></span></strong></span><span><span>长三角地区及全国在读研究生、优秀高年级本科生</span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span>报名条件：</span></span></strong></span><span><span>具有交通运输工程、车辆工程、计算机科学与技术、控制科学与工程、信息与通信工程、电子科学与技术、人工智能等智能网联相关学科专业，对智能网联、自动驾驶、车路协同等领域有浓厚兴趣，具备一定的专业基础知识和科研能力，能够全程参与课程及实践活动。</span></span></span></p><section><img alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/HQ1xrkfdVRVvibiagR2I2FAwzBLH6GosCqIB8ibbPRNKpapNDB3uFGzo1OtPEcQ6iaiaHfVH371BiaCG7Xsr48uOKOQdhoJqOT9wpib1AU6282l6Hc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>5</span></strong></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>报名方式</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>1.采取“自愿报名+单位推荐”的方式进行网上报名，填写2026年江苏省研究生智能网联暑期学校报名表（附件1），由导师或辅导员签字盖章，扫描成PDF文件。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.填写2026年江苏省研究生智能网联暑期学校报名信息汇总表（附件2）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.本人有效身份证件（正、反面）和学生证扫描件，尚无学生证的2026级拟入学研究生提供录取通知书扫描件。</span></span></p><p><span><span>以上材料一起打包，压缩包以“学校名称-专业名称-学员姓名”格式命名，邮件主题：“学员姓名-2026年智能网联暑期学校”，并于2026年8月16日前发送至邮箱：363022634@qq.com。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>附件1和附件2可点击下方链接下载。</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qcGBzjaZhntcd9DELvVpDg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1：2026年江苏省研究生“智能网联”暑期学校报名表</a></span></p><p><span><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qcGBzjaZhntcd9DELvVpDg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2：2026年江苏省研究生“智能网联”暑期学校报名信息汇总表</a></span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>注：申请人提交的全部材料应保证真实和准确，否则将不予受理。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"4.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/HQ1xrkfdVRU8zsv5rdCTAeOrRHd8nnGDXxzauraYReX5v8tOmbqC8MQA0FvwRNMtVMrNtVDkorxepDfhsDES8pk26FGmetm3PyKtGXHrQms/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong title=\"\"><span>6</span></strong></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>招生和选拔</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>招生人数：</span></span></strong></span><span><span>100人</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>录取：</span></span></strong></span><span><span>学校将对报名研究生、优秀高年级本科生进行资格审查，综合考虑报名学生的科研情况（主要包括论文、科研项目和学科竞赛获奖等）、课程学习、专业领域分布以及导师推荐情况，由评审委员会审核后择优录取。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"7.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/HQ1xrkfdVRWSiaXiaUhnDfujWZewR9Syib8R6IXIbo7ulJffiaZvw5drkRHv2icGRI8iaID2zoRuVIN8agfYlzJaUCNQ5ibFqJdyq5EVH7md7a5FNk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>07</span></strong></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>学员待遇</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><span>1.南通大学将为全体学员免费提供必要的学习材料，学费全免。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.学校免费提供食宿，并承担集体外出考察费用。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.学员在校集中培训期间的管理，按照南通大学制定的学员管理制度执行。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.参训学生往返南通的交通费、在通期间的通信费等个人支出由学员本人承担。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.培训结束后经考核合格的学员由江苏省工学4类研究生教学指导委员会和南通大学联合颁发暑期学校结业证书。省内高校在校研究生可据此向培养单位申请2学分，省外高校自行认定学分；优秀者将获得暑期学校优秀学员证书。</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.培训期间，南通大学为全体学员购买团体意外保险。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"9.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/HQ1xrkfdVRVfdlMnxaufxxicGaIID2pld5IhJjDt9ia0Ex2cBF217t5SdOzCiaYQwftuNLGI0CmlKSUkXzmON3f7pKVaiagXC7lWicVYeRZrJc5g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>08</span></strong></span></section></section></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>联系人：</span></span></strong></span><span><span>吕老师</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>联系电话：</span></span></strong></span><span><span>15262760328</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>通讯地址：</span></span></strong></span><span><span>江苏省南通市崇川区啬园路9号南通大学啬园校区交通与土木工程学院</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>邮编：</span></span></strong></span><span><span>226019</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>网址：</span></span></strong></span><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>https://jttm.ntu.edu.cn/</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>电子邮箱：</span></span></strong></span><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><span><span>363022634@qq.com</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>咨询QQ群：</span></span></strong></span><span><span>1092026168</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"c2f35294519ef6813cc1d2581bce98c4.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/HQ1xrkfdVRUvzQkzMt98VrubX6j5J149bXy4R6TEc1fLq6CaEEjpXvjTicoEF22pYOY2XicgfC5bBDXInotoCIAuYb1xRl0kk8H5LVc11fWuU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><